<InfoPage path="/gift-code/" label="Gift code safety" heading="How to Check a Yarrwin Gift Code" title="Yarrwin Gift Code Guide | Verify Promotions Safely" description="A neutral guide to checking Yarrwin gift codes, promotion links and phishing risks." >
  <h2>Check the source</h2><p>Gift codes should be checked inside the platform account or another channel you already trust. Do not treat a code in a comment, forwarded message or unknown website as genuine. We do not publish unverified codes or promise a bonus.</p>
  <h2>Protect your credentials</h2><p>A legitimate redemption flow should not ask you to hand a password or OTP to a stranger. Read the domain before signing in, and stop if a page pressures you to install an APK or pay a fee first.</p>
  <h2>If a code fails</h2><p>Check its expiry and conditions inside the account, then contact support through the platform’s own help route. Keep a screenshot of the message without exposing your password or personal data.</p>
</InfoPage>
